{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20113",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.96,
      "end_seconds": 6.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.91,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I came as soon as they called me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.51,
      "end_seconds": 12.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "of course, leave it there how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 13.9,
      "end_seconds": 25.32,
      "duration_seconds": 11.42,
      "text": "hello, doctor. I'm here with them in case I can help. Um, we came because of pain going down the back of my left leg"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.07,
      "end_seconds": 29.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.74,
      "end_seconds": 33.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "it's been two years now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.79,
      "end_seconds": 40.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.65,
      "text": "Okay, is it there all the time or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.97,
      "end_seconds": 44.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "honestly, a couple of times a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.23,
      "end_seconds": 48.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.94,
      "end_seconds": 58.4,
      "duration_seconds": 7.46,
      "text": "when it starts I tend to get tingling in my left foot as well"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.42,
      "end_seconds": 63.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "So, have you had stiffness in the morning?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.37,
      "end_seconds": 72.79,
      "duration_seconds": 7.42,
      "text": "mm, yes. The tingling in my left foot? That's been for two months"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.19,
      "end_seconds": 81.99,
      "duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "text": "have you had pain going down the back of your left leg before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.67,
      "end_seconds": 90.79,
      "duration_seconds": 8.12,
      "text": "Well, yes, something like this happened last winter, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.43,
      "end_seconds": 96.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "So, have you noticed weight loss or weakness in the foot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.56,
      "end_seconds": 102.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Ah, you know, no, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.03,
      "end_seconds": 108.51,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "Any bladder problems, fever, bowel problems or numbness between the legs at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.21,
      "end_seconds": 116.1,
      "duration_seconds": 6.89,
      "text": "No, uh, no bladder problems, fever, bowel problems or numbness between the legs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.88,
      "end_seconds": 120.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.27,
      "end_seconds": 123.24,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Breathing's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.56,
      "end_seconds": 136.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "what about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.01,
      "end_seconds": 155.22,
      "duration_seconds": 17.21,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure for two years now. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. I've, I've had arthritis in my knees for two years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.19,
      "end_seconds": 161.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "Alright, high blood pressure, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.42,
      "end_seconds": 184.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.4,
      "end_seconds": 189.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "No, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.45,
      "end_seconds": 194.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Alright, are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.75,
      "end_seconds": 202.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.95,
      "text": "Lisinopril. I take it 10 milligrams, once a day for my pressure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 204.73,
      "end_seconds": 213.81,
      "duration_seconds": 9.08,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the lisinopril was 5 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.25,
      "end_seconds": 218.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Hm. Do you have the latest prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.81,
      "end_seconds": 225.95,
      "duration_seconds": 6.14,
      "text": "No, I left it at home. Paracetamol, 650 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.8,
      "end_seconds": 229.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.16,
      "end_seconds": 235.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.8,
      "end_seconds": 239.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.53,
      "end_seconds": 245.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.45,
      "end_seconds": 248.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "What's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.69,
      "end_seconds": 253.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.36,
      "end_seconds": 256.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.14,
      "end_seconds": 266.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.6,
      "end_seconds": 295.39,
      "duration_seconds": 7.79,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 125 over 81, pulse 79, temperature is 36.6 degrees, saturation 97 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.29,
      "end_seconds": 300.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.02,
      "end_seconds": 304.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.99,
      "end_seconds": 322.29,
      "duration_seconds": 9.3,
      "text": "Straight leg raising on the left brings on the leg pain at about forty degrees, and the power and reflexes are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.13,
      "end_seconds": 327.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "You can relax now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 341.93,
      "end_seconds": 353.94,
      "duration_seconds": 12.01,
      "text": "Let me tell you where I've got to. I'm honestly not certain yet. It could be sciatica from a lumbar disc irritation, or it might be a muscle strain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 354.77,
      "end_seconds": 357.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.32,
      "end_seconds": 391.75,
      "duration_seconds": 32.43,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's sciatica from a lumbar disc irritation, and we'll know more once the an MRI of the lower back is back. Let's get an MRI of the lower back, for sciatica. I'll request blood tests, it'll help with back pain. What I'm giving you is naproxen, 500 milligrams, twice a day with food, for one week. That's for back and leg pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 392.28,
      "end_seconds": 401.56,
      "duration_seconds": 9.28,
      "text": "Stay active and keep walking, bed rest makes this slower to settle. Let's get you seen by physiotherapy, I'll arrange the letter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 402.66,
      "end_seconds": 403.36,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 404.53,
      "end_seconds": 414.05,
      "duration_seconds": 9.52,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 416.08,
      "end_seconds": 418.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Okay, um, makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 420.54,
      "end_seconds": 426.73,
      "duration_seconds": 6.19,
      "text": "I'll want another look in four weeks. Right, does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 427.94,
      "end_seconds": 431.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
}